  "notes": "Windows 服务模式更安全。\n\n- Windows 服务模式改用只对本机当前用户开放的专用通道，不再保存访问令牌；旧版安装在设置中更新服务后自动迁移，迁移前照常可用。\n- Android 在已授权 VPN 时使用更合适的前台服务类型，系统不允许时自动回退。\n- 预置新的更新签名公钥，为今后更换签名密钥做准备，更新校验方式不变。\n",
  "notesEn": "Safer Windows service mode.\n\n- Windows service mode now uses a private channel open only to the current local user and no longer stores an access token; existing installs migrate when the service is updated in Settings and keep working until then.\n- Android uses a better-suited foreground service type while VPN permission is granted, falling back automatically when the system refuses it.\n- Ships an additional update-signing public key to prepare for a future key rotation; update verification is unchanged.\n",
